## [tx] filters and reports (Rollcall, Staff Activity, Storage Health), moderation
## [tx] (ban/kick/warn/freeze), scheduled broadcasts, saved commands, the config editor and control
## [tx] panel, server controls (lock, whitelist), dimension locks, player inspection (inventory,
## [tx] ender chest, gear, effects, homes, notes, punishments), Item Watch, warp/rank/privilege
## [tx] administration, playtime ranks, spy sessions, admin-side tickets, and world settings (time,
## [tx] weather, spawn, game rules). All strings are seen only by server staff inside form dialogs.

