## [tx] Land-claim (grief-protection) engine: chat/action-bar messages for the Claim Tool two-corner
## [tx] selection flow, the claim viewer overlay shown when inspecting claimed land, live verdict
## [tx] hints while selecting, and rejection reasons/warnings when creating, expanding, extending or
## [tx] overwriting claims and sub-claims. Land is measured in Minecraft chunks against a
## [tx] playtime-earned area budget.

